Horses-and-Masterminds

2026-09-21

Hunting season has begun in Wyoming. Which means way too many way too early mornings, but also a lot of beautiful horse rides up the mountains and some of the most fantastic views one will ever see. Views only a tiny fraction of this planet's population has ever seen. My wife also has her once-in-a-lifetime bull moose tag, so that is our main focus of the hunts, everything else (at least to me) is secondary.

My current personal projects that I'm actively working on are both tabletop roleplaying games: Old School Essentials and Mutants & Masterminds. More so the latter, which is a superhero game, as you might have guessed. It seems like a pretty good game. Time will tell. I want to run a superhero adventure with YUGE over-the-top encounters! Think the last fight scene from the 1st Deadpool, the one in the ship graveyard/repair yard/whatever that was. Big, fat fights with people getting tossed THROUGH buildings!

Deus vult.

